---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Rig Equipment — Rig Types, Drill String, BOP Explained"
  description="Complete reference for oil rig equipment: rig types, the drill string, blowout preventers, and every major mechanical system on a rig."
  breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Equipment', href: '/equipment' }]}
  lang="en"
  alternateHref="/es/equipment"
>
  <Nav slot="nav" lang="en" alternateHref="/es/equipment" />
  <Footer slot="footer" lang="en" />

  <div class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-eyebrow">02 — Equipment</div>
    <h1>Rig <span>Equipment</span></h1>
    <p class="page-hero-sub">Every core mechanical system on a drilling rig, from the rig itself down to the bit thousands of feet below.</p>
  </div>

  <section class="block">
    <h2 class="sr-only">Equipment guides</h2>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/rig-types">
        <span class="card-icon">🏗️</span>
        <h3>Types of Drilling Rigs</h3>
        <p>Land rigs, jack-ups, semi-submersibles, drillships, platforms, and barges compared with specs and day rates.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/drill-string">
        <span class="card-icon">🔩</span>
        <h3>The Drill String</h3>
        <p>Every component from top drive to bit — drill pipe, collars, BHA, MWD tools, and bit types.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/bop">
        <span class="card-icon">🔒</span>
        <h3>Blowout Preventers</h3>
        <p>How a BOP stack seals the well — annular preventers, rams, pressure ratings, and testing requirements.</p>
        <span class="card-link">BOP Types &amp; Stack →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/accumulator">
        <span class="card-icon">🧯</span>
        <h3>Accumulator Function Test &amp; Drill</h3>
        <p>Initial pressure, per-component open/close timing against API STD 53, recharge time, and drill report sections.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/bridge-plug">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/bridge-plug-1.jpg" alt="Bridge Plug" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Bridge Plug</h3>
        <p>Drillable vs. retrievable, wireline vs. mechanical setting, pressure/temp ratings, failure modes, and how it differs from a cement retainer.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/casing-cutter">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/casing-cutter-1.jpg" alt="Casing Cutter" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Casing Cutter</h3>
        <p>Mechanical vs. chemical cutting, running and actuation, generic ratings, failure modes, and how it differs from a section mill.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/section-mill">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/section-mill-1.jpg" alt="Section Mill" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Section Mill</h3>
        <p>Single-trip vs. two-trip mills, swarf handling, generic ratings, failure modes, and how it differs from a casing cutter.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/window-mill">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/window-mill-1.jpg" alt="Window Mill" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Window Mill</h3>
        <p>The starting/window/taper mill sequence, whipstock setting and orientation, failure modes, and how it differs from a section mill.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/safety-joint">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/safety-joint-1.jpg" alt="Safety Joint" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Safety Joint</h3>
        <p>Mechanical vs. hydraulic release designs, where it's placed in a fishing or liner string, and common failure modes.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/mwd-tool">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/mwd-tool-1.jpg" alt="MWD Tool" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>MWD Tool</h3>
        <p>Mud pulse telemetry, MWD vs. LWD, where it sits in the BHA, and common failure modes.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/packer">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/packer-1.jpg" alt="Packer" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Packer</h3>
        <p>Permanent vs. retrievable, the polished bore receptacle, and how it differs from a bridge plug.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/whipstock">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/whipstock-1.jpg" alt="Whipstock" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Whipstock</h3>
        <p>How its concave face deflects a window mill into the casing wall, the pilot lug, and orientation before milling.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/liner-hanger">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/liner-hanger-1.jpg" alt="Liner Hanger" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Liner Hanger</h3>
        <p>Why a liner runs instead of full casing, how the slips carry its weight, and the liner top packer.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/cement-retainer">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/cement-retainer-1.jpg" alt="Cement Retainer" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Cement Retainer</h3>
        <p>How the pump-through valve works during a squeeze job, drillable vs. retrievable, and how it differs from a bridge plug.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/float-sub">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/float-sub-1.jpg" alt="Float Sub" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Float Sub</h3>
        <p>How its flapper or ball-and-seat check valve stops backflow, and how it differs from a float shoe or collar.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/crossover-sub">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/crossover-sub-1.jpg" alt="Crossover Sub" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Crossover Sub</h3>
        <p>Joining different thread types and diameters in a string, the tapered-shoulder failure point, and how it differs from a bit sub.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/under-reamer">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/under-reamer-1.jpg" alt="Under-Reamer" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Under-Reamer</h3>
        <p>Folding arms that pass a restriction closed then cut hole wider once extended, hydraulic vs. mechanical actuation, failure modes, and how it differs from a hole opener.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/stabilizer">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/stabilizer-1.jpg" alt="Stabilizer" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Stabilizer</h3>
        <p>String vs. near-bit vs. roller-reamer placement, straight vs. spiral blade design, failure modes, and how it differs from an under-reamer.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/reversing-tool">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/reversing-tool-1.jpg" alt="Reversing Tool" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Reversing Tool</h3>
        <p>How reverse circulation carries junk and debris back up the string, port actuation, failure modes, and how it differs from a float sub.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/hydraulic-jar">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/hydraulic-jar-1.jpg" alt="Hydraulic Jar" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Hydraulic Jar</h3>
        <p>Up jar vs. down jar, how a jar accelerator stores extra energy, failure modes, and how it differs from a safety joint.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/sliding-sleeve">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/sliding-sleeve-1.jpg" alt="Sliding Sleeve" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Sliding Sleeve</h3>
        <p>Shifting tool operation, zonal isolation and circulation uses, and common failure modes.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/burr-mill">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/burr-mill-1.jpg" alt="Burr Mill" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Burr Mill</h3>
        <p>Dressing sharp edges after a cutting or milling pass, and how it differs from a section mill.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/nmdc-pony-nmdc">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/nmdc-pony-nmdc-1.jpg" alt="NMDC / Pony NMDC" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>NMDC / Pony NMDC</h3>
        <p>Why MWD tools need non-magnetic spacing, how it's calculated, and what happens when it's wrong.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/lifting-sub">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/lifting-sub-1.jpg" alt="Lifting Sub" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Lifting Sub</h3>
        <p>A handling accessory, not a downhole tool — how it differs from a crossover sub.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/pup-joint">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/pup-joint-1.jpg" alt="Pup Joint" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Pup Joint</h3>
        <p>Precise string spacing with the same thread and diameter, and how it differs from a crossover sub.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/positive-displacement-mud-motor">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/positive-displacement-mud-motor-1.jpg" alt="Positive Displacement Mud Motor" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Positive Displacement Mud Motor</h3>
        <p>How the Moineau principle converts fluid flow into bit rotation, sliding vs. rotating drilling.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/scssv">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/scssv-1.jpg" alt="SCSSV Safety Valve" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>SCSSV Safety Valve</h3>
        <p>Fail-safe by design, regulatory requirements, and common failure modes.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/gas-lift-mandrel">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/gas-lift-mandrel-1.jpg" alt="Gas Lift Mandrel" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Gas Lift Mandrel</h3>
        <p>Side-pocket design for wireline valve retrieval, and mandrel spacing for staged unloading.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/blast-joint">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/blast-joint-1.jpg" alt="Blast Joint" loading="lazy" />
