        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/tcp-gun">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/tcp-gun-1.jpg" alt="TCP Gun" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>TCP Gun</h3>
        <p>Run on tubing instead of wireline — how it's fired downhole and common failure modes.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/tubing-plug">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/tubing-plug-1.jpg" alt="Tubing Plug" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Tubing Plug</h3>
        <p>A wireline-retrievable plug set into a landing nipple to block tubing flow at a chosen depth.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/casing-patch">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/casing-patch-1.jpg" alt="Casing Patch" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Casing Patch</h3>
        <p>A short expandable liner that restores pressure integrity across damaged casing from the inside.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/landing-nipple">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/landing-nipple-1.jpg" alt="Landing Nipple" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Landing Nipple</h3>
        <p>A precision-machined profile giving plugs, valves, and gauges a fixed point to lock into on wireline.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/on-off-tool">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/on-off-tool-1.jpg" alt="On-Off Tool" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>On-Off Tool</h3>
        <p>Lets the tubing string disconnect and later reconnect to a packer below without unseating it.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/casing-shoe">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/casing-shoe-1.jpg" alt="Casing Shoe" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Casing Shoe</h3>
        <p>The rounded nose on the bottom of a casing string, guiding it past ledges on the way into the hole.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/centralizer">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/centralizer-1.jpg" alt="Centralizer" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Centralizer</h3>
        <p>Clamps onto the casing OD and holds the string centered so cement forms an even sheath.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/mule-shoe">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/mule-shoe-1.jpg" alt="Mule Shoe" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Mule Shoe</h3>
        <p>A beveled guide nose that helps a string slide past ledges and sharp window edges on the way in.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/bull-nose-plug">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/bull-nose-plug-1.jpg" alt="Bull Nose Plug" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Bull Nose Plug</h3>
        <p>A solid, blind guide nose that protects whatever's below the string from debris, no flow passage.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/jetting-tool">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/jetting-tool-1.jpg" alt="Jetting Tool" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Jetting Tool</h3>
        <p>Directs high-velocity fluid jets to erode fill and debris out of the wellbore.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/expandable-sand-screen">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/expandable-sand-screen-1.jpg" alt="Expandable Sand Screen" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Expandable Sand Screen</h3>
        <p>Runs at a reduced diameter, then expands against the formation wall to filter sand.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/casing-roller-dressing-tool">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/casing-roller-dressing-tool-1.jpg" alt="Casing Roller / Dressing Tool" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Casing Roller / Dressing Tool</h3>
        <p>Restores a round internal profile to dented casing by rolling the wall back toward shape.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/wash-pipe">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/wash-pipe-1.jpg" alt="Wash Pipe" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Wash Pipe</h3>
        <p>Large-diameter pipe run over a stuck fish to circulate away the fill actually gripping it.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/well-protector">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/well-protector-1.jpg" alt="Well Protector" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Well Protector</h3>
        <p>Shields wellhead sealing surfaces during intervention, and doubles as a debris-collection tool during BOP cleaning.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/fishing-swivel">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/fishing-swivel-1.jpg" alt="Fishing Swivel" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Fishing Swivel</h3>
        <p>A bearing-based downhole swivel that isolates torque in a fishing string, letting a releasing tool turn independently.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/bumper-sub">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/bumper-sub-1.jpg" alt="Bumper Sub" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>Bumper Sub</h3>
        <p>A telescoping tool that lets a jar's impact strike cleanly instead of stretching out through the pipe.</p>
        <span class="card-link">Read More →</span>
      </a>
      <a class="card" href="/equipment/sabs-dabs">
        <img class="card-thumb" src="/images/equipment/sabs-dabs-1.jpg" alt="SABS vs. DABS" loading="lazy" />
        <h3>SABS vs. DABS</h3>
